e boundary points of $A.$\n\nThe set $A$ and its boundary $∂A$ are shown below.\n\n![](images/71/71851a12f638da9604450cae0d50ed15187e850368890845d60b16b89e728bcf.png)\n\nThe interior of a set $A,$ denoted $\\text{int}\\,A,$ is the set containing all the interior points of $A.$ It contains every point in $A$ except the boundary points: \n\n$$\n\\text{int}\\,A=A-∂A\n$$\n\nThe interior of $A$ is shown below.\n\n![](images/ab/abdd434da59bb3a1bdc0ee7de398d7ea4aeae2f617f54b5a26a5bad871ba0ac4.png)\n\nSo, in this case, the interior of $A$ is given by\n\n$$\n\\text{int}\\,A={(x,y)\\in {R}^{2}\\,:\\,-2<x<0,\\,0<y<2\\,}.\n$$" 13194139533530 17592186045585 true] [17592186407139 1058 #edb/ref 17592186407141 13194139533530 17592186045585 true] [17592186407139 1062 #uuid "2c059530-0946-5277-be5a-d012a040ea0c" 13194139533530 17592186045585 true] [17592186407139 1063 #edb/ref 17592186278578 13194139533530 17592186045585 true] [17592186407140 1058 #edb/ref 17592186407139 13194139533530 17592186045585 true] [17592186407140 1062 #uuid "402d691f-f025-5fda-a714-cdf450986aae" 13194139533530 17592186045585 true] [17592186407140 1063 #edb/ref 17592186407138 13194139533530 17592186045585 true] [17592186407141 1058 #edb/ref 17592186407143 13194139533530 17592186045585 true] [17592186407141 1062 #uuid "792002f7-8976-53c6-927a-3e52d881bb37" 13194139533530 17592186045585 true] [17592186407141 1063 #edb/ref 17592186278580 13194139533530 17592186045585 true] [17592186407142 1062 #uuid "8b91c588-b8dd-5d0f-bb39-1c50d03a3a31" 13194139533530 17592186045585 true] [17592186407142 1063 #edb/ref 17592186281312 13194139533530 17592186045585 true] [17592186407143 1058 #edb/ref 17592186407142 13194139533530 17592186045585 true] [17592186407143 1062 #uuid "a1abd988-5a8d-5e08-8366-ca4c63f4e968" 13194139533530 17592186045585 true] [17592186407143 1063 #edb/ref 17592186281308 13194139533530 17592186045585 true]] :edb/tempids {"activity-76e2698b-8be0-5d8e-90fa-0fb9464d3b79" 17592186407131 "answer-1343a63e-0338-55